kind: cargo
description: |
  sqv -- Sequoia's OpenPGP signature verifier.  systemd-sysupdate checks the
  update manifest's signature (SHA256SUMS.gpg) by running `gpg`; bunix's
  `gpg` is a small wrapper that hands that check to sqv (files/rootfs).

build-depends:
- bootstrap/build-env.bst
- bootstrap/rust.bst
- base/pkgconf.bst
- base/botan.bst

